":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749979983","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104537#issuecomment-2749979983","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104537","id":2749979983,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j6V1P","user":{"login":"AllenDang","id":18550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenDang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AllenDang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T03:36:48Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T03:36:48Z","body":"@zaevi Thing is fusion-pixel-12px-monospaced-zh_hans does have 1 dc in macOS v15, but have 151 dc in windows 11.\n\nHere is the screenshot from windows 11.\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70cefde0-3af5-44ba-a68c-a535aa6e9466)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2749979983/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2750032270","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104537#issuecomment-2750032270","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104537","id":2750032270,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j6imO","user":{"login":"zaevi","id":12966814,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTY2ODE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12966814?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi","html_url":"https://github.com/zaevi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zaevi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-25T04:18:50Z","updated_at":"2025-03-25T04:18:50Z","body":"I also tested it on Windows 11\n\n**System information**\n\nGodot v4.5.dev.mono (0013d30c9) - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13700F (24 threads)\n\n(Same result on 4.4.stable)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2750032270/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2765833393","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104537#issuecomment-2765833393","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104537","id":2765833393,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k20Sx","user":{"login":"chocola-mint","id":56677134,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2Njc3MTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56677134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint","html_url":"https://github.com/chocola-mint","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T10:36:24Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T11:30:12Z","body":"Looking into this with RenderDoc, the renderer seems to be alternating between two different 256x256 white textures that look completely identical.\n\nHere's the capture for those interested: [capture-godot-104537.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19533816/capture-godot-104537.zip)\n\nOut of curiosity I also tested out the project with the Forward+ renderer (Vulkan backend) and while the draw call issue is present, there's a bit more information here.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a3b075e-e25b-45a0-9dab-5753d465e984)\n\nIt seems that the character glyphs are split into multiple 256x256 atlases. Having to switch between atlases when rendering is what's causing the batches to break. And presumably this atlas generation is different depending on the how the glyphs are loaded dynamically, which is why the result can differ between machines and fonts.\n\nA larger atlas size would be enough to address this issue, though this doesn't seem to be configurable on the user's end.\n\nAnd again, here's the Vulkan capture for those interested: [capture-godot-vulkan-104537.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19533936/capture-godot-vulkan-104537.zip)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2765833393/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767543993","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104537#issuecomment-2767543993","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104537","id":2767543993,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k9V65","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T22:19:02Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T22:19:02Z","body":"CC @bruvzg ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767543993/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767550475","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104537#issuecomment-2767550475","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104537","id":2767550475,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k9XgL","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T22:22:33Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T22:22:33Z","body":"Atlas size is small since updating large textures is extremely slow on some devices, and Godot does not have an exposed way to update only part of the texture (or at least did bot when it was implemented).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2767550475/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":