ps://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-04T07:46:05Z","updated_at":"2025-04-04T07:53:38Z","body":"> perhaps there could be an option to bake a list of glyphs into a pre-computed atlas in the importer settings?\n\nThere is an option to do so for a custom imported font, in the advanced import dialog (it is designed for MSDF fonts, since MSDF generation is slow, but work with any font config), but currently it won't solve the issue, since it still will use the same texture size.\n\n> If the performance of partial texture updates by dynamic fonts is an issue\n\nIt was performance issue, but this should be rechecked, size was decreased a long time ago.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777840660/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2778307680","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104537#issuecomment-2778307680","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104537","id":2778307680,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lmZxg","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","ava